gametitle=Mega Man X7 (Ns Edition v1.5.2) (NTSC-U) SLUS-20487 55AC9791

[No-Interlacing]
author=heavyjam
description=Forces progressive output (SMODE2 INT=0) and removes the per-field half-line offset. Game logic still believes it is interlaced, which it requires for its vsync/field waits.
